sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as 👤 Teammate
    participant UI as 💬 Chat
    participant O as ⚙️ Orchestrator
    participant S as 📦 Sandbox
    participant G as 🦊 Git forge

    U->>UI: "add a volume discount to Travel"
    UI->>O: POST /api/orgs/:org/tasks
    Note over O: session → membership → role check
    O->>G: git clone (token injected in memory only)
    O->>O: move .git out of the agent's sight
    O->>S: docker run (working tree mounted, no secret)
    loop the agent works
        S-->>O: JSON events (text, tool calls)
        O-->>UI: live stream (SSE)
    end
    rect rgb(236, 253, 245)
        O->>S: run the check command (no network)
        alt the check fails (3 attempts max)
            O->>S: re-run the agent with the error output
        end
    end
    O->>G: commit + push branch atelier/‹id›
    O->>G: open the MR / PR (flagged if a protected path changed)
    O-->>UI: ready: link to the proposal
    U->>G: review, test, merge
    O->>O: delete the working directory
